# Two intersecting planar quads - PainterAI / Apple IIGS test
# Orthographic XY projection; +Z is farther from camera.
# Faces intersect along the line x=0, y in [-1,1], z=0.
# Face A: horizontal plane z=0.
# Face B: sloping plane z=x, behind A for x>0 and ahead for x<0.
o IntersectingQuads
v -1.0 -1.0  0.0
v  1.0 -1.0  0.0
v  1.0  1.0  0.0
v -1.0  1.0  0.0
v -1.0 -1.0 -1.0
v  1.0 -1.0  1.0
v  1.0  1.0  1.0
v -1.0  1.0 -1.0
f 1 2 3 4
f 5 6 7 8
